Flexible Software Package (FSP)
###############################

Origin:
   Renesas Electronics Corporation
   https://www.renesas.com/us/en/software-tool/flexible-software-package-fsp

Status:
   T.B.D

Purpose:
   Flexible Software Package (FSP) for Renesas RX MCU Family.

Description:
   This package is a snapshot from the RX FSP software released by Renesas Electronics Corporation
   It contain the HAL and a set of CMSIS headers files for the Renesas RX MCUs

Dependencies:
    None.

URL:
   https://github.com/renesas/fsp

Commit:
   T.B.D

Maintained-by:
   Renesas Electronics Corporation

License:
   BSD-3-Clause

License Link:
   https://opensource.org/licenses/BSD-3-Clause

Patch List:

   * Remove the static definition in bsp_group_irq.c
   Impacted files:
      drivers/rx/fsp/src/bsp/mcu/all/bsp_group_irq.c

   * Update BSP_ICU_IRQ_HANDLER macro definition in bsp_irq.h
   Impacted files:
      drivers/rx/fsp/src/bsp/mcu/all/bsp_irq.h

   * Add vector number macros for CANFD driver
   Impacted files:
      zephyr/rx/fsp_cfg/r_canfd_cfg.h

   * Update DEVADD_b size to match hardware spec
   Impacted files:
      drivers/rx/fsp/src/bsp/cmsis/Device/RENESAS/Include/R5K574M/r_usb_basic_reg.h

   * Update PLACE_IN_RAM_SECTION definitions in r_mram.h to use the standard `.ramfunc section` instead of legacy `.code_in_ram`
   Impacted files:
      drivers/rx/fsp/inc/instances/r_mram.h

   * Made non-static functions to allow access from Zephyr
   Impacted files:
      drivers/rx/fsp/src/r_sdhi/r_sdhi.c

   * Made update to ospi driver to add address mode and write data mask setting
      drivers/rx/fsp/src/r_xspi_controller/r_xspi_controller.c
      driver/rx/fsp/inc/instances/r_xspi_controller.h

   * Add phy link configure skip for RMAC and ESWM module, phylink configure is done in Zephyr side
      drivers/rx/fsp/src/r_rmac/r_rmac.c
      drivers/rx/fsp/src/r_layer3_switch/r_layer3_switch.c
      zephyr/rx/fsp_cfg/r_rmac_cfg.h
      zephyr/rx/fsp_cfg/r_layer3_switch_cfg.h
